{"tool_name":"covidmine","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"covidmine","home":"http://covid.apps.intermine.org/","license":"LGPL-2.1","summary":"CovidMine is an InterMine dedicated to COVID-19 / SARS-CoV-2 data which\nintegrates confirmed Covid-19 cases, deaths, Sars-CoV-2 reference genome\nand nucleotide sequences from isolates deposited in Genbank","addition_date":"2020-06-09T11:05:25Z","last_update_date":"2024-11-24T20:28:44.286484Z","tool_type":["Database portal","Web application","Web service"],"collections":["COVID-19"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:covidmine","cost":"Free of charge","credit":[{"email":"support@intermine.org","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Support"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["API documentation"],"url":"http://intermine.org/im-docs/docs/web-services/index"},{"type":["User manual"],"url":"https://flymine.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"public"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Data retrieval","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2422"},{"term":"Query and retrieval","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0224"},{"term":"Visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0337"}]}],"maturity":"Emerging","name":"CovidMine","operating_system":["Linux","Mac"],"owner":"InterMine","publication":[{"doi":"10.1093/bioinformatics/bts577","metadata":{"abstract":"InterMine is an open-source data warehouse system that facilitates the building of databases with complex data integration requirements and a need for a fast customizable query facility. Using InterMine, large biological databases can be created from a range of heterogeneous data sources, and the extensible data model allows for easy integration of new data types. The analysis tools include a flexible query builder, genomic region search and a library of 'widgets' performing various statistical analyses. The results can be exported in many commonly used formats. InterMine is a fully extensible framework where develo